{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02569","headline":"宣正殿芝草 · 李义府","name":"宣正殿芝草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明王敦孝感，宝殿秀灵芝。\n色带朝阳净，光涵雨露滋。\n且标宣德重，更引国恩施。\n圣祚今无限，微臣乐未移。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李义府","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}